\p{Construct categorical diagrams, derived cone/comma categories, limits, witness transport, and shape extensions. Prove \ref{at-up-0001} through \ref{at-up-0008}, including the corrected \code{sk_n ⊣ cosk_n} orientation and the Čech diagram's coherence. Add slice/functor/limit closure certificates with their implementations, not as earlier axioms.}
\p{\strong{Exit:} all eight tests, duality scope, and nontrivial witness/extension clients pass. \strong{Freeze:} the validated universal-property definitions and API.}
